Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Construct feasible alternatives such as resequencing, substitution, or phased completion within approved design constraints. Obtain exact estimates from authorized services, disclose assumptions, and preserve professional review requirements for structural or safety consequences.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
